 #       DOI 10.1143/JPSJ.74.1674
 #     'Chern Numbers in Discretized Brillouin Zone: 
 #  Efficient Method of Computing (Spin) Hall Conductances'
 #*Ref2: T. Fukui and Y. Hatsugai, J. Phys. Soc. Jpn.
 #       76, 053702 (2007), DOI 10.1143/JPSJ.76.053702
 #     'Lattice Computation of Z2 Topological 
 #      Invariants and Its Application to Bi and Sb'
 #*Ref3: R. Resta, J. Phys.: Condens. Matter. 12, R107 (2000)
 #     'Menifestations of Berry's phase in molecules 
